{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:53:41+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:53:41+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Belgrano","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Conglomerates","country":"France","city":"Paris","website":"https://chargeurs.com","employees":1441,"summary":"Belgrano operates as an industrial and financial company in France, Italy, Germany, the United States, Mainland China, Hong Kong, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Culture & Education, Fashion & Know how, and Innovative Materials. The company provides Museum Studio platform that includes a portfolio of services comprising planning and implementation of cultural projects and permanent exhibitions to the publication of works of art, as well as management of museum bookshops. It also produces and markets high-end interlinings for clothing and accessories; and technical textiles for the military, navy and architecture under the Senfa Cilander brand; luxury fibers, which comprise combed wool, natural fibers, and eco-designed merino wool under NATIVA brand; and personal goods are developed, produce and market accessory and leather goods under Cambridge Satchel, Altesse Studio, and Swaine. The company was formerly known as Compagnie Chargeurs Invest and changed its name to Belgrano in September 2026. Belgrano was founded in 1872 and is headquartered in Paris, France.","exchange":"Paris","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Belgrano opère en tant que société industrielle et financière en France, en Italie, en Allemagne, aux États-Unis, en Chine continentale, à Hong Kong, au Royaume-Uni et à l'international. Il opère à travers trois segments : Culture & Education, Mode & Savoir-faire et Matériaux Innovants. La société fournit une plate-forme Museum Studio qui comprend un portefeuille de services comprenant la planification et la mise e